+### Backend Wiring --- How Filters Are Applied
+
+**Frontend:** - On Chats mount / filter change → build payload from
+local `DiscoveryFilters` state - Call Edge Function `social_discovery`
+with full payload - Tier-gated fields only sent if user has the required
+tier (frontend gate + backend validation)
