+### A10.2 Confirm critical tables
+```bash
+psql "$DATABASE_URL" -P pager=off -c "\d+ public.profiles"
+psql "$DATABASE_URL" -P pager=off -c "\d+ public.user_quotas"
+psql "$DATABASE_URL" -P pager=off -c "\d+ public.map_alerts"
+psql "$DATABASE_URL" -P pager=off -c "\d+ public.marketplace_bookings"
+```
+
+### A10.3 Confirm indexes
+```bash
+psql "$DATABASE_URL" -P pager=off -c "
+select tablename, indexname, indexdef
+from pg_indexes
+where schemaname='public'
+  and tablename in ('profiles','user_quotas','map_alerts','discovery_skips','marketplace_bookings')
+order by tablename, indexname;
+"
+```
+
+### A10.4 Confirm RLS/policies
+```bash
+psql "$DATABASE_URL" -P pager=off -c "
+select c.relname as table, c.relrowsecurity as rls_enabled
+from pg_class c
+join pg_namespace n on n.oid=c.relnamespace
+where n.nspname='public' and c.relkind='r'
+order by 1;
+"
+
+psql "$DATABASE_URL" -P pager=off -c "
+select schemaname, tablename, policyname, roles, cmd
+from pg_policies
+where schemaname='public'
+order by tablename, policyname;
+"
+```
+
+### A10.5 Confirm cron jobs (if available)
+```bash
+psql "$DATABASE_URL" -P pager=off -c "select * from cron.job order by jobid;"
+```
